+Adapted from ArkLib 22dbd4e836c15a21f68889afa69b7130da04abbb,
+AffineLines/GoodCoeffs.lean:212,464. Direct polynomial-matrix interface;
+all coding hypotheses are supplied by the existing Selvage RS layer.
